graph LR
    %% 스타일 정의
    classDef input node, fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    classDef aug fill:#f9e79f,stroke:#f39c12,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef backbone fill:#aed6f1,stroke:#2980b9,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef head fill:#abebc6,stroke:#27ae60,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef loss fill:#f5b7b1,stroke:#c0392b,stroke-width:2px;

    %% 노드 및 연결
    Input[Input Image<br/>(Insert CXR Here)]:::input
    
    Input -->|View 1| Weak[Weak Augmentation<br/>Rotation / Translation]:::aug
    Input -->|View 2| Strong[Strong Augmentation<br/>Blur / Color / Crop]:::aug
    
    Weak --> Backbone[Xception Backbone<br/>Feature Extraction]:::backbone
    Strong --> Backbone
    
    Backbone -->|Features| ICH[Instance Head<br/>(ICH)]:::head
    Backbone -->|Features| CCH[Cluster Head<br/>(CCH)]:::head
    
    ICH --> Loss((Twin-Contrastive<br/>InfoNCE Loss)):::loss
    CCH --> Loss
